            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Coconut_Oil_Extract.webp",
            "title": "Organic Virgin Coconut Oil",
            "title_size": "medium",
            "text": "<p><em>Absorbing moisturizer.<\/em> Cold-pressed and unrefined, this oil keeps its full lauric acid and medium-chain fatty acid profile. The MCFAs absorb into the skin barrier instead of forming a film on top of it. Refined coconut oil is uniform and shelf-stable because the lab strips out the variation — and most of what makes the oil work.<\/p>",
