          "settings": {
            "background_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/red-palm-fruit.webp",
            "title": "Organic Red Palm Oil",
            "title_size": "medium",
            "text": "<p><em>Vitamin E and beta-carotene source.<\/em> Unrefined red palm oil delivers naturally occurring vitamin E and tocotrienols — antioxidants that support the skin barrier and help protect cells from oxidative stress. The deep red-orange color is the carotenoids themselves, not added pigment. Sustainably sourced from RSPO-certified supply chains.<\/p>",
