    "founder-block": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "founder-heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "From The Founder",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "founder-body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We started Real Skin Care because our family wanted products where every ingredient earned its place. The lotion aisle was where this hit hardest — bottle after bottle of mineral oil, undisclosed fragrance, and parabens, marketed as nourishing.<\/p><p>We wanted something our kids could use that absorbed instead of coated. Every oil in this bottle is cold-pressed and unrefined. That's the line we drew, and we won't cross it for profit.<\/p><p>— Sean Fillmore<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        }
      },
